SUMMARY:Summer Community Lane Swims- $4
LOCATION:Pool - Deep End
DESCRIPTION:Queen's Aquatics is welcoming community members to join us for lane and open rec swim times\, June 29th- August 29th.\n\n\nPlease note:\n$4 Community Swims are for lane swims only and cannot be used to access other parts of the facility.\n\nNo refunds. Please be aware that lane and rec swim times may change due to program\, event\, and staff demands - for the most up to date schedule information\, download the Queen’s Get Active app for iOS or Google Play. Don’t forget to allow notification alerts!
